docs {
  # Health Check
  
  No authentication required. Returns server uptime and timestamp.
  
  ## Response
  ```json
  {
    "status": "ok",
    "uptime": 6953,
    "timestamp": "2026-05-08T22:45:26.573Z"
  }
  ```
}
